{"page":257,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"250","words":[{"text":"250","x":193,"y":142,"width":73,"height":34}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":567,"y":144,"width":124,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":702,"y":146,"width":33,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":768,"y":152,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":813,"y":147,"width":132,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":955,"y":146,"width":52,"height":29}]},{"text":"시간","words":[{"text":"시간","x":874,"y":1258,"width":54,"height":29}]},{"text":"그림 3.50 • TCP 술로 스타트","words":[{"text":"그림","x":523,"y":1325,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"3.50","x":590,"y":1326,"width":70,"height":30},{"text":"•","x":675,"y":1333,"width":16,"height":14},{"text":"TCP","x":705,"y":1328,"width":65,"height":28},{"text":"술로","x":780,"y":1326,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"스타트","x":845,"y":1326,"width":86,"height":32}]},{"text":"으로 증가하게 된다.","words":[{"text":"으로","x":526,"y":1477,"width":68,"height":30},{"text":"증가하게","x":605,"y":1474,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":755,"y":1474,"width":73,"height":39}]},{"text":"72H의 세그언e","words":[{"text":"72H의","x":1115,"y":489,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"세그언e","x":1189,"y":501,"width":106,"height":34}]},{"text":"22H의 세그어E","words":[{"text":"22H의","x":1166,"y":705,"width":74,"height":34},{"text":"세그어E","x":1247,"y":718,"width":106,"height":28}]},{"text":"42d의 서/그어e","words":[{"text":"42d의","x":1283,"y":934,"width":73,"height":34},{"text":"서/그어e","x":1364,"y":945,"width":108,"height":28}]},{"text":"시간","words":[{"text":"시간","x":1508,"y":1264,"width":57,"height":30}]},{"text":"그러나 이 지수적 증가는 언제 끝나는 것인가? 슬로 스타트는 이 질문에 몇 가지","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":593,"y":1537,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":711,"y":1537,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"지수적","x":760,"y":1537,"width":95,"height":40},{"text":"증가는","x":873,"y":1538,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"언제","x":993,"y":1538,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"끝나는","x":1074,"y":1538,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"것인가?","x":1195,"y":1539,"width":120,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":1331,"y":1541,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"스타트는","x":1417,"y":1542,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1578,"y":1544,"width":31,"height":39},{"text":"질문에","x":1630,"y":1544,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"몇","x":1754,"y":1544,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"가지","x":1802,"y":1545,"width":57,"height":41}]},{"text":"답을 제공한다. 첫 번째, 만약에 타임이웃에 의한 손실 이벤트(즉, 혼잡)가 있을 경우,","words":[{"text":"답을","x":527,"y":1599,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":611,"y":1599,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"첫","x":772,"y":1601,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"번째,","x":820,"y":1601,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"만약에","x":911,"y":1602,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"타임이웃에","x":1028,"y":1601,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"의한","x":1216,"y":1601,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"손실","x":1300,"y":1602,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"이벤트(즉,","x":1388,"y":1603,"width":163,"height":42},{"text":"혼잡)가","x":1568,"y":1607,"width":125,"height":39},{"text":"있을","x":1711,"y":1606,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"경우,","x":1795,"y":1608,"width":67,"height":40}]},{"text":"TCP 송신자는 cwnd값을 1로 하고, 새로운 슬로 스타트를 시작한다. 또한, TCP 송신","words":[{"text":"TCP","x":525,"y":1666,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"송신자는","x":611,"y":1662,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"cwnd값을","x":762,"y":1664,"width":160,"height":39},{"text":"1로","x":938,"y":1669,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"하고,","x":1002,"y":1665,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"새로운","x":1093,"y":1664,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"슬로","x":1210,"y":1664,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"스타트를","x":1294,"y":1664,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"시작한다.","x":1450,"y":1667,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"또한,","x":1618,"y":1669,"width":80,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1714,"y":1673,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"송신","x":1801,"y":1670,"width":61,"height":39}]},{"text":"자는 두 번째 상태 변수 인 ssthresh (\"slow start threshold”, 슬로 스타트 임계치의","words":[{"text":"자는","x":526,"y":1724,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":607,"y":1727,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"번째","x":656,"y":1725,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"상태","x":734,"y":1726,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"변수","x":816,"y":1726,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"인","x":896,"y":1728,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"ssthresh","x":942,"y":1733,"width":185,"height":29},{"text":"(\"slow","x":1141,"y":1728,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"start","x":1255,"y":1737,"width":67,"height":24},{"text":"threshold”,","x":1335,"y":1730,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"슬로","x":1524,"y":1730,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"스타트","x":1610,"y":1731,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"임계치의","x":1734,"y":1731,"width":127,"height":41}]},{"text":"약자) 값을 cwnd/2(혼잡이 검출 되었을 시점에서의 혼잡 원도우값의 반)으로 정한","words":[{"text":"약자)","x":526,"y":1786,"width":80,"height":41},{"text":"값을","x":625,"y":1788,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"cwnd/2(혼잡이","x":710,"y":1790,"width":250,"height":39},{"text":"검출","x":983,"y":1791,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"되었을","x":1067,"y":1790,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"시점에서의","x":1187,"y":1790,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡","x":1377,"y":1791,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"원도우값의","x":1467,"y":1793,"width":175,"height":40},{"text":"반)으로","x":1664,"y":1794,"width":121,"height":40},{"text":"정한","x":1804,"y":1795,"width":61,"height":39}]},{"text":"다. 두 번째로, 슬로 스타트가 끝나는 방법은 ssthresh값과 직접적으로 연관된다.","words":[{"text":"다.","x":526,"y":1849,"width":41,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":586,"y":1852,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"번째로,","x":639,"y":1850,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":765,"y":1851,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"스타트가","x":849,"y":1853,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"끝나는","x":1002,"y":1853,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"방법은","x":1123,"y":1854,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"ssthresh값과","x":1244,"y":1855,"width":263,"height":40},{"text":"직접적으로","x":1525,"y":1857,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"연관된다.","x":1725,"y":1856,"width":139,"height":40}]},{"text":"ssthresh가 혼잡이 마지막 김출된 시점에서의 cwnd값의 반이므로, 이 값에 도달","words":[{"text":"ssthresh가","x":528,"y":1913,"width":221,"height":40},{"text":"혼잡이","x":763,"y":1914,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"마지막","x":881,"y":1915,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"김출된","x":1001,"y":1916,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"시점에서의","x":1119,"y":1917,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"cwnd값의","x":1308,"y":1918,"width":163,"height":40},{"text":"반이므로,","x":1491,"y":1920,"width":152,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1664,"y":1919,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"값에","x":1715,"y":1919,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"도달","x":1802,"y":1920,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"하거나 지나질 때 cwnd를 계속 두 배로 하는 것은 신중하지 못할 것이다. 그러므로","words":[{"text":"하거나","x":527,"y":1976,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"지나질","x":646,"y":1976,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":764,"y":1976,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"cwnd를","x":812,"y":1980,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"계속","x":957,"y":1979,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1039,"y":1981,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"배로","x":1091,"y":1980,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"하는","x":1176,"y":1981,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"것은","x":1263,"y":1980,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"신중하지","x":1348,"y":1980,"width":136,"height":41},{"text":"못할","x":1505,"y":1983,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1596,"y":1982,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"그러므로","x":1731,"y":1982,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"cwnd값이 ssthresh과 같으면, 슬로 스타트는 종료되고 TCP는 혼잡 회피 모드로","words":[{"text":"cwnd값이","x":528,"y":2040,"width":156,"height":39},{"text":"ssthresh과","x":705,"y":2040,"width":219,"height":39},{"text":"같으면,","x":939,"y":2042,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":1065,"y":2042,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"스타트는","x":1151,"y":2045,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"종료되고","x":1304,"y":2043,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"TCP는","x":1460,"y":2047,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"혼잡","x":1588,"y":2045,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"회피","x":1679,"y":2044,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"모드로","x":1766,"y":2049,"width":99,"height":28}]},{"text":"전환한다. 곧 보겠지만, TCP는 혼잡 회피 모드에서 cwnd를 좀 더 조심스럽게 증가시","words":[{"text":"전환한다.","x":529,"y":2103,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"곧","x":685,"y":2105,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"보겠지만,","x":732,"y":2102,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"TCP는","x":889,"y":2107,"width":106,"height":35},{"text":"혼잡","x":1008,"y":2104,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"회피","x":1091,"y":2105,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"모드에서","x":1172,"y":2106,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"cwnd를","x":1325,"y":2108,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"좀","x":1469,"y":2109,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1521,"y":2107,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"조심스럽게","x":1568,"y":2106,"width":181,"height":39},{"text":"증가시","x":1765,"y":2106,"width":96,"height":38}]},{"text":"킨다. 마지막으로, 슬로 스타트가 종료될 수 있는 방법은 만약 3개의 중복 ACK들이","words":[{"text":"킨다.","x":529,"y":2165,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"마지막으로,","x":620,"y":2166,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"슬로","x":814,"y":2165,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"스타트가","x":898,"y":2166,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"종료될","x":1049,"y":2167,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1168,"y":2168,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있는","x":1222,"y":2168,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"방법은","x":1305,"y":2168,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"만약","x":1427,"y":2168,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"3개의","x":1514,"y":2168,"width":89,"height":38},{"text":"중복","x":1624,"y":2169,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"ACK들이","x":1714,"y":2169,"width":147,"height":38}]},{"text":"검출 되면, 다음에 설명하겠지만 TCP는 빠른 재전송(3.5.4절 참조)을 수행하여 빠른","words":[{"text":"검출","x":528,"y":2228,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"되면,","x":611,"y":2228,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"다음에","x":704,"y":2227,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"설명하겠지만","x":820,"y":2227,"width":204,"height":40},{"text":"TCP는","x":1039,"y":2231,"width":106,"height":35},{"text":"빠른","x":1162,"y":2230,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"재전송(3.5.4절","x":1247,"y":2230,"width":231,"height":39},{"text":"참조)을","x":1498,"y":2231,"width":123,"height":39},{"text":"수행하여","x":1637,"y":2231,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"빠른","x":1800,"y":2231,"width":65,"height":39}]},{"text":"회복 상태로 들어간다. TCP의 슬로 스타트에서의 행동은 그림 3.51 에서 TCP 혼잡제","words":[{"text":"회복","x":527,"y":2291,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"상태로","x":608,"y":2291,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"들어간다.","x":722,"y":2290,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"TCP의","x":880,"y":2291,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":1000,"y":2290,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"스타트에서의","x":1083,"y":2291,"width":203,"height":40},{"text":"행동은","x":1305,"y":2293,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":1424,"y":2293,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"3.51","x":1510,"y":2298,"width":66,"height":30},{"text":"에서","x":1585,"y":2294,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"TCP","x":1671,"y":2299,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"혼잡제","x":1763,"y":2295,"width":98,"height":38}]},{"text":"어의 FSM 설명으로 요약된다. 슬로 스타트 알고리즘은 [Jacobson 1988]에 뿌리를 두","words":[{"text":"어의","x":528,"y":2354,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"FSM","x":606,"y":2359,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"설명으로","x":698,"y":2354,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"요약된다.","x":844,"y":2353,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":1003,"y":2354,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"스타트","x":1083,"y":2353,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":1200,"y":2354,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"[Jacobson","x":1388,"y":2360,"width":160,"height":35},{"text":"1988]에","x":1568,"y":2358,"width":127,"height":40},{"text":"뿌리를","x":1713,"y":2357,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":1833,"y":2359,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"고 있으며, 슬로 스타트와 유사한 방식은 [Jain 1986]에서 독립적으로 제안되었다.","words":[{"text":"고","x":526,"y":2422,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"있으며,","x":575,"y":2417,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"슬로","x":694,"y":2417,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"스타트와","x":774,"y":2415,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"유사한","x":921,"y":2416,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"방식은","x":1036,"y":2415,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"[Jain","x":1151,"y":2420,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"1986]에서","x":1241,"y":2418,"width":155,"height":40},{"text":"독립적으로","x":1413,"y":2419,"width":181,"height":40},{"text":"제안되었다.","x":1608,"y":2420,"width":189,"height":39}]},{"text":"혼잡회피","words":[{"text":"혼잡회피","x":527,"y":2523,"width":149,"height":44}]},{"text":"혼잡 회피 상태로 들어가는 시점에서 cwnd의 값은 대략 혼잡이 마지막 발견된 시점","words":[{"text":"혼잡","x":528,"y":2598,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"회피","x":612,"y":2599,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"상태로","x":693,"y":2599,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"들어가는","x":808,"y":2599,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"시점에서","x":960,"y":2598,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"cwnd의","x":1110,"y":2597,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"값은","x":1253,"y":2598,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"대략","x":1338,"y":2599,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡이","x":1421,"y":2601,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":1546,"y":2603,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"발견된","x":1673,"y":2602,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"시점","x":1798,"y":2601,"width":62,"height":38}]}]}